## SQ-STN-01 | each station takes containers only into its container slot and carrots only into ingredient slots, from the top and the side
@group A
@commands For each of the five stations: a hopper above it and a hopper pointing into one side, each holding 4 of the station's container (pot / copper pot: `minecraft:bowl`; kettle: `minecraft:glass_bottle`; oven: the container of a muffin recipe, probe `BakingRecipe.getOutputContainer`; jar: `vintagedelight:mason_jar` or the first `#vintagedelight:container_items` item) and 4 of a plain ingredient (`minecraft:carrot`); wait 100 ticks; `/data get block` each station
@pass Every station: the containers are all in its container slot (pot 7, copper pot 5, kettle 3, oven 8, jar 6) and no container in an ingredient slot; the carrots are all in ingredient slots and none in the container slot; both hoppers empty (from the top and from the side)
@fails Slot rule: `StationSlotRule` / `forge.ItemStackHandlerSlotRuleMixin` (pot, kettle; log `Mixin apply failed`), `isItemValid` in `CopperPotBlockEntity`, `OvenBlockEntity.createHandler`, `FermentingJarBlockEntity`; faces: `CookingPotItemHandlerMixin`, `KettleItemHandlerMixin`, `CopperPotItemHandler.insertItem`, `FermentingJarItemHandler.insertRouted`. Empty container set: `StationContainers` built before recipes (check the generation bump)
