## SQ-STN-02 | outputs then leftovers leave through a hopper below; the container stays; the jar's inputs are not pulled from below or the side
@group A
@commands For each station: `/data merge block` an item in each output slot, a leftover slot item and a container in the container slot; a hopper under it; on the jar also a Create andesite funnel on one side face (extracting into a chest); wait 200 ticks
@pass Hopper (and the jar's side funnel) gets the outputs, then the leftover items; the container slot still holds its container on every station; the jar's ingredients are not pulled from below or the side
@fails `RemainderOutputHandler` (pot, kettle, oven), `CopperPotItemHandler.extractItem`, `FermentingJarItemHandler.forSide` (SIDE_VIEW / OUTPUTS)
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
