## SQ-STN-03 | Pickling Jar progress restarts when the recipe changes; kimchi only after its full time
@group A
@commands Jar: `/data merge block` 5 cucumbers and `#forge:salt` salt (a pickle recipe, 2400 ticks); wait 1400 ticks; `/data get block ... "fermenting_jar.progress"`; replace the inputs with 4 cabbage leaves, 1 salt, 1 onion (kimchi from onion, 2400 ticks); wait 20 ticks; read progress again; wait 2300 more ticks; `/data get block`
@pass First read about 1400; after the swap the progress is under 40 (restarted); no kimchi in slot 7 before 2400 ticks after the swap, 4 kimchi by 2420
@fails `FermentingJarBlockEntity.tick` `progressRecipe` check; if the kimchi still comes early, log `recipe.getId()` and `getProcessingTime()` per tick
@from batches/r1113/fix_c2a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
