## SQ-STN-04 | kettle brew time 600 from the default config
@group A
@commands A heated kettle (lit campfire), water tank, one `farmersrespite:black_tea_leaves` in slot 0 and one in slot 1; read `BrewTimeTotal` after 5 ticks. Then `qrun.py toml creativedelight-common.toml cooking.kettleBrewTicks 300`, `/reload`, empty and refill the kettle the same way
@pass First `BrewTimeTotal` 600 and the tea appears at about 600 ticks; after the change 300. The FD pot and the oven still read their own recipe times (an FD pot recipe's `CookTimeTotal` equals the recipe's `cookingtime`)
@fails `KettleRecipeSerializerMixin.ce$cookingTime` fallback; NCH `frBrewing` must not write `cookingtime` (check a dumped recipe json)
