## SQ-STN-06 | FD pot plates from the remainder buffer: one bowl, five bowls, a bottle that never moves
@group A
@commands FD pot on a lit campfire: `/data merge block` slot 7 empty, a bowl in buffer slot 0 (`ForgeCaps` / the pack's buffer NBT, see RemainderBufferStorage), the meal slot 6 with 3 `farmersdelight:vegetable_soup`; read the block every 2 ticks for 40 ticks. Repeat with 5 bowls in the buffer, then with a glass bottle in the buffer
@pass One bowl: the bowl stays in the buffer about 10 ticks, then slot 7 holds it about 10 ticks, then slot 8 holds 1 soup. Five bowls: 3 move to slot 7, 2 stay in the buffer, 3 soups plated. Glass bottle: never moves, the soup waits
@fails `RemainderBuffer.pullForPlating` (called from `CookingPotRemainderMixin.ce$pullTick` HEAD of `cookingTick`), shared `OverflowPull`
@from batches/r1113/fix_c2a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
